  "description": "Murder has just been legalized in the Republic of Terragua. It’s chaos for everyone that doesn’t fall in line the corrupted system but heaven for those in power. The Assassination bill allows assassins to arrange and commit murder as long as they follow the legal guidelines. Maya is a young assassin taking advantage of the new economic boom of legalized murder. Her life changes when another assassin, Rama, thwarts the biggest assassination of her career. After losing everything, Maya demands accountability from Rama, while in fact, he is the one that’s seeking justice.\n\n(Source: Webtoons)",
